                <pb facs="0443" n="421" sameAs="frus:frus1872p2v2/pg421"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Davis to Mr.
                            Favrot</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure No. 9.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Geneva</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1872-04-15"><hi rendition="#italic">April</hi> 15,
                        1872</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have to inclose a letter for each of the
                    Arbitrators and for Lord Tenterden, which I will thank you to forward to
                    them.</p>
                <p>I am. &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>J. C. B.DAVIS.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
